estar/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-25T05:20:22Z","updated_at":"2025-04-25T05:20:22Z","body":"If it's added for consistency with 3D should it also have the same options that 3D has? I expect people who use those settings might want same behavior in both 2D and 3D\r\n\r\n<img width=\"589\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d1b583c1-dc96-4c56-8f6e-a30bc5bcfebc\" />\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2829400653/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2829656710","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105625#issuecomment-2829656710","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105625","id":2829656710,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6oqSKG","user":{"login":"zmn-hamid","id":129656474,"node_id":"U_kgDOB7pmmg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/129656474?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zmn-hamid","html_url":"https://github.com/zmn-hamid","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zmn-hamid/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zmn-hamid/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zmn-hamid/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zmn-hamid/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zmn-hamid/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zmn-hamid/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zmn-hamid/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zmn-hamid/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zmn-hamid/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-25T07:57:43Z","updated_at":"2025-04-25T07:57:53Z","body":"> If it's added for consistency with 3D should it also have the same options that 3D has? I expect people who use those settings might want same behavior in both 2D and 3D\n> \n> <img width=\"589\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d1b583c1-dc96-4c56-8f6e-a30bc5bcfebc\" />\n> \n\nMakes sense, I'll work on them. but I think we should instead separate these settings and make them more global. Because:\n1. Less redundancy\n2. The feature that I'm adding right now isn't limited to the 2D scene, it works on any editor. But the other one is only for the 3D viewport.\n\nHowever I'm not sure under which category I should put in these new settings. Any suggestions? ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2829656710/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2829749989","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105625#issuecomment-2829749989","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105625","id":2829749989,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6oqo7l","user":{"login":"passivestar","id":60579014,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwNTc5MDE0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60579014?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar","html_url":"https://github.com/passivestar","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-25T08:37:08Z","updated_at":"2025-04-25T08:55:45Z","body":"> However I'm not sure under which category I should put in these new settings. Any suggestions?\r\n\r\nI'm not sure tbh, could be `editors/common`. It seems like overall categories could use some reorganization, because while most sections in \"Editors\" could be described as \"editors\", there's also \"Panning\" which is not an editor, it would probably make more sense in `editors/common/panning` and then common zoom settings could be in `editors/common/zooming`. (Or to be more precise they could be in `editors/common/navigation/(panning/zooming)` for consistency with 3d-specific ones at the `editors/3d/navigation` path). Also `editors/3d_gizmos` could probably be in `editors/3d/gizmos` because \"3D Gizmos\" is not an editor either\r\n\r\nThere are some other things in settings overall that don't seem to make sense, like `interface/editor` and `interface/editors` being separate categories.\r\n\r\nNeed to hear from maintainers on what to do about it and whether there are any plans to clean up the categories (maybe a lot at once in a single engine update so that it's easier to migrate them), then it will be easier to decide where to add these.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2829749989/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2829889282","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105625#issuecomment-2829889282","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105625","id":2829889282,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6orK8C","user":{"login":"zmn-hamid","id":129656474,"node_id":"U_kgDOB7pmmg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/129656474?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zmn-hamid","html_url":"https://github.com/zmn-hamid","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zmn-hamid/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zmn-hamid/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zmn-hamid/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zmn-hamid/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zmn-hamid/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zmn-hamid/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zmn-hamid/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zmn-hamid/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zmn-hamid/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-25T09:32:35Z","updated_at":"2025-04-25T09:32:35Z","body":"> Need to hear from maintainers on what to do about it and whether there are any plans to clean up the categories (maybe a lot at once in a single engine update so that it's easier to migrate them), then it will be easier to decide where to add these.\r\n\r\nCompletely agreed. Since Editors > 3D is full of related settings, changing anything about it will fall out of the scope of this commit. I'll add `zoom_mouse_button` and `zoom_style` bellow `editors/2d/zoom_speed_factor` for now (It's a bit tricky for my skillset but I'll work on that). Further reorganization can be done in a separate PR.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2829889282/reactions","total_